  ('69462bb97b78013c4213b5b1', 'Best earthquake preparedness kits for families?', 'best-earthquake-preparedness-kits-for-families-4213b5b1', 'preparedness', 'EastBayMom', 'Dublin', 'With all the recent activity, I want to make sure my family is prepared. What emergency kits do you all recommend? Looking for something comprehensive but not too expensive. We have 2 kids (ages 5 and 8) and a dog.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 178, 6, 1765452424561, 'StartupLife', 1764656440603, 1765452424561, NULL),
  ('69462bba7b78013c4213b5b8', 'Understanding the Calaveras Fault - Resources?', 'understanding-the-calaveras-fault-resources-4213b5b8', 'science', 'BayAreaResident', 'Pleasanton', 'I''m trying to learn more about the fault system under San Ramon/Dublin area. Can anyone recommend good resources or explain why we''re seeing so much activity lately? I''m fascinated by the geology here.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 672, 6, 1766358944756, 'Priti', 1764276251071, 1766358944756, NULL),
  ('69462bba7b78013c4213b5be', 'Anyone else''s pets acting weird before quakes?', 'anyone-elses-pets-acting-weird-before-quakes-4213b5be', 'general', 'ApartmentDweller', 'Fremont', 'My dog has been super restless the past week and seems to know when a quake is coming. About 30 seconds before the last one, she started whining and hid under the bed. Anyone else notice this with their pets?', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 158, 7, 1766358414762, 'Eduardo', 1766013286053, 1766358414762, NULL),
  ('69462bba7b78013c4213b5c1', 'How do you explain earthquakes to young kids?', 'how-do-you-explain-earthquakes-to-young-kids-4213b5c1', 'neighborhood', 'WFHLife', 'Cupertino', 'My 4-year-old has been asking a lot of questions after feeling some of the recent quakes. How do you all talk to your little ones about earthquakes without scaring them? Looking for age-appropriate ways to explain it.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 640, 6, 1770082865147, 'idk', 1764942641057, 1770082865147, NULL),
  ('69462bba7b78013c4213b5c7', 'Renters: Is your building up to code?', 'renters-is-your-building-up-to-code-4213b5c7', 'preparedness', 'DogWalker', 'Cupertino', 'I''m renting an older apartment building in Oakland (built in 1960s). After all this earthquake activity, I''m wondering if my building is safe. How do I find out if it''s been retrofitted? Anyone know what to look for?', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 316, 6, 1766148942689, 'EarlyBird', 1765461387024, 1766148942689, NULL),
  ('69462bba7b78013c4213b5cd', 'Emergency communication plan - what''s yours?', 'emergency-communication-plan-whats-yours-4213b5cd', 'preparedness', 'Foodie925', 'El Cerrito', 'If the big one hits and cell towers go down, how are you planning to reach your family? We''re scattered across the Bay Area during work/school hours. Looking for ideas on emergency communication plans.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 364, 6, 1765618620375, 'BayNative', 1765116544941, 1765618620375, NULL),
  ('69462bbb7b78013c4213b5d4', 'San Ramon residents - how are you all doing with the swarm?', 'san-ramon-residents-how-are-you-all-doing-with-the-swarm-4213b5d4', 'neighborhood', 'OldTimer', 'San Ramon', 'Been a wild couple of weeks with all these quakes centered right under us. How''s everyone holding up? Any damage reports or just the usual shaking? My kids are getting jumpy every time the house creaks now.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 445, 4, 1765317194038, 'Concerned_Citizen', 1765217581686, 1765317194038, NULL),
  ('69462bbb7b78013c4213b5d9', 'Dublin: Anyone know about the construction and ground stability?', 'dublin-anyone-know-about-the-construction-and-ground-stabili-4213b5d9', 'neighborhood', 'OldTimer', 'Dublin', 'With all the new development happening in Dublin and the ongoing earthquake swarm, I''m curious if anyone knows how the new buildings are being designed for seismic safety. Seems like important info given our location on the fault.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 383, 4, 1765776240755, 'Foodie925', 1765730510849, 1765776240755, NULL),
  ('69462bbb7b78013c4213b5de', 'East Bay earthquake preparedness meetup?', 'east-bay-earthquake-preparedness-meetup-4213b5de', 'neighborhood', 'CommutingPro', 'Danville', 'Would anyone be interested in an informal meetup to discuss earthquake preparedness? We could share tips, maybe do a neighborhood walk to identify safe spots and hazards. I''m in the Danville/San Ramon area but happy to meet anywhere accessible.', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 466, 4, 1765251009036, 'Foodie925', 1765114860076, 1765251009036, NULL),
  ('6981519a1358e499d11c1f29', 'wild day', 'wild-day-ml5xjniz', 'general', 'imran', NULL, 'been on edge since we woke up', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 2, 1, 1770082714330, 'imran', 1770082714330, 1770082714330, NULL),
